						],
						"pointId": 10984
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751790601,
					"content": "Phew... what a mess to deal with. To think that I almost got knocked flat by some Tepetlisaurs... That just boils my blood!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751790602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Itzayah"
				},
				{
					"id": 751790602,
					"content": "You've got it all wrong — those are Abyssal monsters! They're way more dangerous than Tepetlisaurs. So you thought they were just ordinary ones... No wonder you struggled!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751790603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751790603,
					"content": "Hah, is that it? Makes sense now. I really owe you this time. If it weren't for you guys, I'd have been done for.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751790604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Itzayah"
				},
				{
					"id": 751790604,
					"content": "Hold on a sec, I need to go round up those useless idiots first. I'll thank you properly once I make sure they're all safe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751790605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Itzayah"
				},
				{
					"id": 751790605,
					"content": "With your help, the people from the caravan gradually gather around.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
